ket.jpg","c":"","id":"B153-61","w":"April 1964"},{"f":"crops/B212/B212-p10-elder-statesmen.jpg","c":"Our picture shows four of the club's elder statesmen in a relaxed mood during this year's Centenary Club '20' road race. ... They are (left to right) :- Ken O'Kell (86) - 64 years a member, Bill Webb (93) - 60 years a member, Frank Webb (84) - 59 years a member, Norman Dewberry (85) - 59 years a member","id":"B212-15","w":"April 1988"},{"f":"crops/B221/B221-p08-alan-mead-finish.jpg","c":"It's 1963 and in the match versus the German club Turnverein 1862 Langen at Battersea Park, Alan holds the kerb into the second lap of the Junior 880 before a long sprint for victory. Frank Webb is the track judge.","id":"B221-23","w":"Winter 1993/94"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B212/B212-p10-elder-statesmen.jpg","caption":"Our picture shows four of the club's elder statesmen in a relaxed mood during this year's Centenary Club '20' road race. ... They are (left to right) :- Ken O'Kell (86) - 64 years a member, Bill Webb (93) - 60 years a member, Frank Webb (84) - 59 years a member, Norman Dewberry (85) - 59 years a member","source":"B212-15","when":"April 1988"},"x":1,"share":{"d":"Frank Webb in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1928–1995: 246 mentions in 107 issues, 124 race results and 7 photographs. Wrote or reported 6 items.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B153/B153-p34-derby-draw-ticket.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-frank-webb.html"},"legend":false}